-    TheoremThreeHypotheses C3 ε lam ep0 h0 → IsDS ε lam σ → w ≠ 0 →
-    cGr (nPlus ε) (nMinus ε) * (Real.pi ^ (nPlus ε * nMinus ε) *
-        (c0 / (2 * N * lamAbs lam)) ^ (nPlus ε * nMinus ε) / ((nPlus ε * nMinus ε).factorial : ℝ)) *
-        ((Module.finrank ℂ (lowKSub ε lam σ) : ℝ) / 4) ≤
